direction: down

source: |md
  **Current minimal**

  Canonical instructions and allowlists

  Installed settings and packages
|

deploy: |md
  **One Pi deployment**

  Generate `generated/pi-agent`

  Deploy to `~/.pi/agent`
|

launch: |md
  **Switch the launchers**

  Shell, updater, workers, Docker
|

state: |md
  **Preserve Pi data**

  Keep shared credentials and models

  Merge every session root and remap fork links
|

verify: |md
  **Verify in staging**

  Check settings, history, and launchers
|

archive: |md
  **Activate the staged agent**

  Archive the original directories

  Smoke-test plain Pi and launchers
|

source -> deploy
deploy -> verify
launch -> verify
state -> verify
verify -> archive
